BakerHousingTip: Xenon: There are many fruits you can obtain by hitting a tree with your axe. Keeping such fruits in your inventory will attract a baker.
UniqueCavesTip: Xenon: In the caverns you can find unique caves made out of Marble, Granite or Rhyolite.
HoeToolsTip: Xenon: Hoes can be used to gather seeds, torches and even unique goodies. You can craft a simple hoe using Bars and Wood at a workbench
OreTierTips: Xenon: Xenon introduces a new batch of ores. However are they are in between Vanilla ores in terms of power. Like Aluminum being inbetween Copper and Tin.
BanditTips: Xenon: Bandits can be spotted outside of the evil biomes and drop all sorts of things like rope and torches. Bandits become more common the more bosses you slay. Take precaution as they are very deadly.
ScorchingIceTip: Xenon: In the Ice biome, a new strange biome exists which contains a new gem. Flint! Pack an Obsidian Skin Potion however.
UndergroundOceanTip: Xenon: Underneath the ocean on the side of the jungle lays a new cave containing more gems, sharks and crabs!
ValuablesTips: Xenon: There are some rare type of items that sell for alot of coin! they can be crafted, found or dropped from enemies.
FeelTheImpactTip: Xenon: There is Gel, Pink Gel and new White Gel. White gel is used for Impact Bombs, Grenades and Dynamite. Craft one, toss at a distance or height and feel the impact!
SlowDownTip: Xenon: Slow down and enjoy your playthrough! This is a mod meant for slower paced players. Building and Fishing are great ways to slow down a playthough without putting arbitrary limits on yourself.
XenonConfigTip: Xenon: Xenon is a mod meant to be highly configurable. from Basic Gameplay Changes too Master Mode Changes! these can be enabled or disabled depending on what you want!
ReplaceTheHallowSpreadTip: Xenon: The Hallow is the only place where Corruption, Corrosion and Crimson cannot spread.
ReplaceThePwnhammerTip: Xenon: Demon Altars, Crimson Altars and Gastric Altars can't be destroyed with a nromal hammar. You have to pwn them.
ReplaceTheShadowOrbTip: Xenon: You can destroy Shadow Orbs, Kidney Stones and Crimson Hearts with a hammer or explosives, but prepare yourself for the forces they unleash.
ThankThePlayerTip: Xenon: Thank you for playing Xenon! This may not be the best mod, but its a mod made with love and passion!
